#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-hexsoon-24g.rst:7
#: 1ca95269cec04e7eac2db547edda0abd 90d42c7594624e96a0e69e73ed2a2f16
#: b069fef31444403798c335c402037bdd d4bfcc792d254d5a878aa1384569deba
#: e3b2fb29232d4114bf124ef05520fbaf
msgid ""
"The `Hexsoon 24G radar <http://www.hexsoon.com/en/list-4-27.html>`__ "
"(available in `20m "
"<http://www.hexsoon.com/en/product/product-96-167.html>`__, `100m "
"<http://www.hexsoon.com/en/product/product-88-685.html>`__, and `200m "
"<http://www.hexsoon.com/en/product/product-85-346.html>`__ versions) are "
"24Ghz-band radar useful for :ref:`surface tracking <copter:terrain-"
"following-manual-modes>`, :ref:`terrain following <copter:terrain-"
"following>` and :ref:`object avoidance <common-object-avoidance-landing-"
"page>`"
msgstr ""
"`Hexsoon 24G 雷达 <http://www.hexsoon.com/en/list-4-27.html>`__ （提供 `20m "
"<http://www.hexsoon.com/en/product/product-96-167.html>`__、`100m "
"<http://www.hexsoon.com/en/product/product-88-685.html>`__ 和 `200m "
"<http://www.hexsoon.com/en/product/product-85-346.html>`__ 版本）是 24GHz "
"频段雷达，适用于 :ref:`地面跟踪 <copter:terrain-following-manual-modes>`、:ref:`地形跟随 "
"<copter:terrain-following>` 和 :ref:`避障 <common-object-avoidance-landing-"
"page>`"

