#: d13440869f7b46428cfa55bb45ee8673
msgid ""
"ArduPilot does not currently support the same type of CAN rangefinders "
"connected to different CAN ports. If you would like to use multiple CAN "
"rangefinders together, connect them to the same CAN port."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 目前不支持将相同类型的 CAN 测距仪连接到不同的 CAN 接口。如果需要同时使用多个 CAN 测距仪，请将它们连接到同一个 CAN"
" 接口。"

